/* ==================================================================
   prompts-text.js — fill-in-the-blank text prompt templates.

   Loaded only by the four category pages (ppt / essay / report / email).
   index.html, images.html and builder.html have no use for it and do not
   pull it down.

   Fields: filename (display label), prompt (the text), tag (filter group
   — the chip row on each page is built from the tags present, so adding a
   new tag here makes a new filter appear with no other edit).

   [bracketed] words are auto-highlighted as fill-in variables — keep
   placeholders in that format.
   ================================================================== */
